{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/389b513f58763d54709860ede2b494b5.avif?t=1761757672\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of the Lake is an atmospheric visual novel horror inspired by classic cinema.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds in a Soviet summer camp by a mysterious lake,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where an ordinary vacation slowly turns into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Janis, a boy who arrives at the camp filled with carefree voices,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the scent of pine trees, and the sound of flagpoles clinking in the wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything feels familiar and peaceful\u2026 until whispers begin to rise from beneath the water,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and unease starts to spread across the faces of your friends \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a fear no one can explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/97b66a13a09fcb42c0dd9a05f49a6646.avif?t=1761757672\" width=500 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about a childhood that won\u2019t let go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About a secret buried in the depths, and an attempt to understand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >what really happened many years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps, by telling this story, you too will feel the call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dare to look into the past if it calls to you from the depths? \ud83d\udc80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/6e26db7b61b6c1ce6414ce3313c1ed2b.avif?t=1761757672\" width=150 height=150 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/fed66b5033a0a2702f4ab0fb896f4298.avif?t=1761757672\" width=150 height=150 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/47a6b0b4b07cecb3daf984f2d3f23916.avif?t=1761757672\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac Cinematic visual style \u2014 inspired by engravings and etchings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 The atmosphere of a Soviet summer camp \u2014 friendship, warmth, and a dark mystery beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Nonlinear narrative with multiple endings \u2014 your choices decide how the story concludes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Immersive sound design \u2014 realistic ambient sounds, wind, whispers, and an original soundtrack create a sense of presence.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118240?t=1761757672","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118240?t=1761757672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/54d84a3996efaea490fef14b01f50f42e07d7e5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761757672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/54d84a3996efaea490fef14b01f50f42e07d7e5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761757672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},