h\" >what really happened many years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps, by telling this story, you too will feel the call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dare to look into the past if it calls to you from the depths? \ud83d\udc80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/6e26db7b61b6c1ce6414ce3313c1ed2b.avif?t=1761757672\" width=150 height=150 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/fed66b5033a0a2702f4ab0fb896f4298.avif?t=1761757672\" width=150 height=150 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/47a6b0b4b07cecb3daf984f2d3f23916.avif?t=1761757672\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac Cinematic visual style \u2014 inspired by engravings and etchings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 The atmosphere of a Soviet summer camp \u2014 friendship, warmth, and a dark mystery beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Nonlinear narrative with multiple endings \u2014 your choices decide how the story concludes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Immersive sound design \u2014 realistic ambient sounds, wind, whispers, and an original soundtrack create a sense of presence.</p>","developers":["StarryFrame Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/06db23a9ff9fc310e666b290d4504f62430f